<office:document xmlns:office="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:office:1.0" xmlns:style="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:style:1.0" xmlns:text="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:text:1.0" xmlns:table="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:table:1.0" xmlns:fo="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:xsl-fo-compatible:1.0" xmlns:svg="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:svg-compatible:1.0" office:version="1.3" office:mimetype="application/vnd.oasis.opendocument.text">
<office:font-face-decls><style:font-face style:name="Liberation Sans" svg:font-family="'Liberation Sans'"/></office:font-face-decls>
<office:styles>
<style:default-style style:family="paragraph"><style:text-properties style:font-name="Liberation Sans" fo:font-size="7.5pt"/></style:default-style>
<style:style style:name="Title" style:family="paragraph"><style:paragraph-properties fo:margin-bottom="0.03in" fo:text-align="center"/><style:text-properties fo:font-size="14pt" fo:font-weight="bold"/></style:style>
<style:style style:name="Sub" style:family="paragraph"><style:paragraph-properties fo:margin-bottom="0.06in" fo:text-align="center"/><style:text-properties fo:font-size="7.5pt" fo:font-style="italic"/></style:style>
<style:style style:name="T" style:family="paragraph"><style:paragraph-properties fo:margin="0in"/></style:style>
<style:style style:name="N" style:family="paragraph"><style:paragraph-properties fo:margin="0in"/><style:text-properties fo:font-weight="bold" fo:font-size="9pt"/></style:style>
<style:style style:name="W" style:family="paragraph"><style:paragraph-properties fo:margin-top="0.03in"/><style:text-properties fo:font-weight="bold"/></style:style>
<style:style style:name="HT" style:family="paragraph"><style:paragraph-properties fo:margin="0in"/><style:text-properties fo:font-weight="bold" fo:color="#ffffff" fo:font-size="9pt"/></style:style>
<style:style style:name="Foot" style:family="paragraph"><style:paragraph-properties fo:margin-top="0.08in"/><style:text-properties fo:font-size="8pt"/></style:style>
<text:list-style style:name="L"><text:list-level-style-number text:level="1" style:num-suffix="." style:num-format="1"><style:list-level-properties text:list-level-position-and-space-mode="label-alignment"><style:list-level-label-alignment text:label-followed-by="listtab" text:list-tab-stop-position="0.14in" fo:text-indent="-0.14in" fo:margin-left="0.14in"/></style:list-level-properties></text:list-level-style-number></text:list-style>
</office:styles>
<office:automatic-styles>
<style:page-layout style:name="pm1"><style:page-layout-properties fo:page-width="8.5in" fo:page-height="11in" fo:margin-top="0.4in" fo:margin-bottom="0.4in" fo:margin-left="0.45in" fo:margin-right="0.45in"/></style:page-layout>
<style:style style:name="TB" style:family="table"><style:table-properties style:width="7.6in" table:align="margins"/></style:style>
<style:style style:name="TB2" style:family="table"><style:table-properties style:width="7.6in" table:align="margins" fo:break-before="page"/></style:style>
<style:style style:name="c1" style:family="table-column"><style:table-column-properties style:column-width="0.95in"/></style:style>
<style:style style:name="c2" style:family="table-column"><style:table-column-properties style:column-width="1.45in"/></style:style>
<style:style style:name="c3" style:family="table-column"><style:table-column-properties style:column-width="3.5in"/></style:style>
<style:style style:name="c4" style:family="table-column"><style:table-column-properties style:column-width="1.7in"/></style:style>
<style:style style:name="C" style:family="table-cell"><style:table-cell-properties fo:padding="0.035in" fo:border="0.5pt solid #808080"/></style:style>
<style:style style:name="H" style:family="table-cell"><style:table-cell-properties fo:padding="0.035in" fo:border="0.5pt solid #808080" fo:background-color="#3b3b3b"/></style:style>
</office:automatic-styles>
<office:master-styles><style:master-page style:name="Standard" style:page-layout-name="pm1"/></office:master-styles>
<office:body><office:text>
<text:p text:style-name="Title">Elden Ring NPC Quest Guide</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Sub">Base game, no spoilers. Rest at a grace or leave and return to an area to advance an NPC. Steps are in order; talk to each NPC until their dialogue runs out.</text:p><table:table table:name="Page1" table:style-name="TB"><table:table-column table:style-name="c1"/><table:table-column table:style-name="c2"/><table:table-column table:style-name="c3"/><table:table-column table:style-name="c4"/><table:table-header-rows><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="H" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="HT">NPC</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="H" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="HT">Where to meet</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="H" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="HT">What to do</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="H" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="HT">Where they go next</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row></table:table-header-rows><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="C" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="N">Roderika</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="T">Stormhill Shack (Limgrave).</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C" office:value-type="string"><text:list text:style-name="L"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Talk until her dialogue runs out (gives Spirit Jellyfish Ashes).</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Stormveil Castle: find Chrysalids' Memento in the dog room next to the large dining room (Rampart Tower grace).</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Give the memento to her at Stormhill Shack.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Roundtable Hold: meet her near the central fireplace.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Ask Smithing Master Hewg about her, then talk to both again. Leave and return.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Any grace: upgrade any Spirit Ash to +4 to unlock a gesture.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Stormveil Castle: pick up the Crimson Hood in the same room as the memento.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Roundtable Hold: after the Erdtree burns, convince Hewg to leave.</text:p></text:list-item></text:list></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="T">Roundtable Hold, near the central fireplace.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="C" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="N">Boc the Seamster</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="T">Limgrave. Hit the small tree east of the telescope south of Agheel Lake North.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C" office:value-type="string"><text:list text:style-name="L"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Talk to him.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Coastal Cave: talk to him beside the grace.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Defeat the Demi-Human Chief Duo. Get the Sewing Needle and Tailoring Tools and bring them to him.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Optional: find him at Lake-Facing Cliffs, East Raya Lucaria Gate and Altus Highway Junction.</text:p></text:list-item></text:list></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="T">East Capital Rampart.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="W">Missable: the item you give him decides how his quest goes.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="C" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="N">Kenneth Haight</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="T">Ruined bridge between Mistwood Outskirts and Third Church of Marika.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C" office:value-type="string"><text:list text:style-name="L"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Accept his request to reclaim Fort Haight.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Fort Haight: defeat the Godrick Knight (drops Bloody Slash).</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Talk to Kenneth: get the Erdsteel Dagger and pledge service.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Rest at any grace. He moves to the Fort Haight battlements.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Fort Haight: clear the Demi-Humans, then talk to him.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Chapel of Anticipation: take the teleporter from The Four Belfries, enter the building next to the starting chapel for the Stormhawk King.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Give the Stormhawk King to Nepheli (not if you gave her Seluvis's Potion).</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Defeat Morgott.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Rest at the Godrick grace, enter the Throne Room, find Kenneth.</text:p></text:list-item></text:list></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="T">Stormveil Throne Room, with Nepheli and Gostoc.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="C" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="N">Nepheli Loux</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="T">Stormveil Castle, room on the troll path.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C" office:value-type="string"><text:list text:style-name="L"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Talk until her dialogue runs out.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Optional: summon her for the Godrick fight.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Roundtable Hold: talk to Gideon Ofnir. She waits outside the library. Exhaust her dialogue.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Village of the Albinaurics: talk to her under the bridge.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Above the village: defeat the Omenkiller.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Roundtable Hold: speak to her in the side room downstairs from Hewg. Give Seluvis's Potion to Gideon Ofnir, not to her.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Roderika must have reached at least step 5 (Hewg talk).</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Kenneth's steps 1-8 must be done. Give her the Stormhawk King.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Defeat Morgott.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Rest at the Godrick grace, enter the Throne Room, talk to her.</text:p></text:list-item></text:list></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="T">Stormveil Throne Room.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="C" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="N">Sorcerer Rogier</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="T">Stormveil Castle chapel. From Liftside Chamber go up over the roofs, then drop to a lower level.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C" office:value-type="string"><text:list text:style-name="L"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Exhaust his dialogue.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Defeat Godrick.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Roundtable Hold: talk to Rogier.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Liftside Chamber: drop from the western wall to the lesser Ulcerated Tree Spirit. Interact with the massive face and the bloodstain near it.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Roundtable Hold: ask Rogier about what happened.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Talk to Fia, choose "Talk in Secret" until you get the Knifeprint Clue map.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Black Knife Catacombs (Liurnia): defeat the Black Knife Assassin behind the illusory wall. Take the Black Knifeprint.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Roundtable Hold: bring the Black Knifeprint to Rogier.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Start Ranni's quest. When you can leave her area, return to Rogier and exhaust his dialogue.</text:p></text:list-item></text:list></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="T">Roundtable Hold. Later steps left out to avoid spoilers.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="C" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="N">Sorceress Sellen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="T">Waypoint Ruins (Limgrave). Defeat the Mad Pumpkin Head, talk to her, accept her offer to study sorcery.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C" office:value-type="string"><text:list text:style-name="L"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Mt. Gelmir, north of Hermit Village: interact with Primeval Sorcerer Azur's body to get Comet Azur.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Waypoint Ruins Cellar: talk to her for the Sellian Sealbreaker Key.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Sellia Hideaway (Caelid): use the key on the seal, find Master Lusat, get Stars of Ruin.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Waypoint Ruins Cellar: return to Sellen for a Starlight Shard (can be done after the next step).</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Defeat Starscourge Radahn, then return to her. She asks you to meet her at Witchbane Ruins.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Witchbane Ruins (south of Fourth Church of Marika): speak to her for Sellen's Primal Glintstone.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Redmane Castle: speak to Witch-Hunter Jerren in the throne room, exhaust his dialogue, rest at a grace.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Witchbane Ruins: Sellen is gone. Speak to Jerren, who is nearby.</text:p></text:list-item></text:list></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="T">Later steps left out to avoid spoilers.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row></table:table><table:table table:name="Page2" table:style-name="TB2"><table:table-column table:style-name="c1"/><table:table-column table:style-name="c2"/><table:table-column table:style-name="c3"/><table:table-column table:style-name="c4"/><table:table-header-rows><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="H" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="HT">NPC</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="H" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="HT">Where to meet</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="H" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="HT">What to do</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="H" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="HT">Where they go next</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row></table:table-header-rows><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="C" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="N">Patches</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="T">Murkwater Cave (Limgrave). Open the chest to start the fight. When he surrenders at about half health, stop attacking and talk.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C" office:value-type="string"><text:list text:style-name="L"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Reload the area so his shop opens.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Optional: open the new chest to teleport to Mistwood. Return for the Calm Down gesture.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Scenic Isle: talk to him.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">First Mt. Gelmir Campsite: head west, follow the rainbow stones to find him.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Volcano Manor: join. He moves to the entrance hall and reopens his shop.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Do one of Tanith's assassination requests, then talk to him for the Letter to Patches.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Volcano Manor area: invade and defeat Great Horned Tragoth. Return, reload, talk to him for the Magma Whip Candlestick.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Defeat Rykard so Patches moves on.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Shaded Castle: find him on the bridge before Elemer of the Briar for the Dancer's Castanets.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Murkwater Cave: he attacks and quickly surrenders. Accept to get Patches' Crouch.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Reload the area. He reopens his shop.</text:p></text:list-item></text:list></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="T">Murkwater Cave.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="W">Missable: do the Candlestick step before you defeat Rykard. Do not kill him at the start.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="C" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="N">Ranni and Blaidd</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="T">Ranni's Rise (Liurnia), after you defeat Royal Knight Loretta at Caria Manor. Agree to serve her.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C" office:value-type="string"><text:list text:style-name="L"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Ranni's Rise tower: speak to the phantoms of Blaidd, Iji and Seluvis, then return to Ranni.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Siofra River: meet Blaidd on the cliff east of Siofra River Bank. He sends you to Seluvis.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Seluvis's Rise (west of Ranni's Rise): visit Seluvis for Seluvis's Introduction. Take it to Sellen at the Waypoint Ruins Cellar.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Siofra River: tell Blaidd what Sellen said. He asks you to meet him at Redmane Castle.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Redmane Castle: start the Radahn Festival, meet Blaidd. Summon him in the fight if you like.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Defeat Radahn, then talk to Blaidd near the Radahn grace.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Eastern Limgrave: enter Nokron through the crater until you get the Fingerslayer Blade.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Ranni's Rise: give her the Fingerslayer Blade.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Carian Study Hall: use the Carian Inverted Statue, reach the Divine Tower of Liurnia for the Cursemark of Death (optional, needed for Fia).</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Renna's Rise: collect the Snow Witch Set, use the waygate at the top to reach Ainsel River Main.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Ainsel River Main: pick up the Miniature Ranni doll, rest at the nearby grace, talk to miniature Ranni three times.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Nokstella: continue through and defeat the Baleful Shadow. She gives you the Discarded Palace Key.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Raya Lucaria Grand Library: open the chest beside Rennala with the key for the Dark Moon Ring.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Grand Cloister: cross the Lake of Rot, interact with the coffin, defeat Astel.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Cathedral of Manus Celes: final step, details left out.</text:p></text:list-item></text:list></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="T">Cathedral of Manus Celes.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="W">Missable: finish Seluvis's quest before Ranni's step 8. Do not give Ranni the Amber Draught.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="C" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="N">Iron Fist Alexander</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="T">Cliff south of Saintsbridge. Attack the ground to free him.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C" office:value-type="string"><text:list text:style-name="L"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Optional: find him in Gael Tunnel.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Redmane Castle: start the Radahn Festival and talk to him before the fight. Summon him if you like.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Radahn's battlefield: talk to him near the Radahn grace.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Optional: cliff south of Divine Tower of Liurnia, free him with an Oil Pot and talk to him.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Lava lake near Seethewater Terminus: defeat the Magma Wyrm and talk to him until he gives you the Jar helmet.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Optional: summon him for the Fire Giant fight.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Crumbling Farum Azula, beyond Dragon Temple Lift: find him.</text:p></text:list-item></text:list></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="T">Crumbling Farum Azula. Final duel left out.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="C" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="N">Millicent and Gowry</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="T">Gowry's Shack (Caelid, before Sellia). Agree to find the Unalloyed Gold Needle. Gowry gives you Sellia's Secret.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C" office:value-type="string"><text:list text:style-name="L"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Swamp of Aeonia: defeat Commander O'Neil and get the needle.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Gowry's Shack: return the needle. Reload or rest, then talk to Gowry for the repaired needle.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Church of the Plague: give the repaired needle to Millicent. Rest at the nearby grace, exhaust her dialogue.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Gowry's Shack: talk to Millicent until her dialogue is exhausted. Reload so she leaves.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">The Shaded Castle: jump into the acid area, climb the tall ladder, follow the northern rampart to the tower, loot Valkyrie's Prosthesis.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Near Erdtree-Gazing Hill: give her the Valkyrie's Prosthesis.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Optional: summon her at Windmill Heights (Godskin Apostle) or the Black Blade Kindred fight.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Ancient Snow Valley Ruins (Mountaintops): talk to her.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Prayer Room (Elphael, Miquella's Haligtree): talk to her.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Drainage Channel area: on a side island in the acid, defeat the lesser Putrid Tree Spirit.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="T">Gowry's Shack: return to Gowry for his rewards.</text:p></text:list-item></text:list></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="T">Gowry's Shack. A mid-quest choice is left out.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row></table:table><text:p text:style-name="Foot">Source: game-checklists.com/elden-ring/all-quests. Quests can conflict with each other; DLC and spoiler-heavy questlines are left out.</text:p></office:text></office:body></office:document>